-id=\"45\">0</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"48\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"47\">9</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span><var mathquill-command-id=\"50\">t</var></span></span></span></div></div>",
